# This package publishes TypeScript source rather than a build, so the line
# endings in the working tree are what npm ships. core.autocrlf=true is set
# globally on this machine, which would otherwise turn the LF sources into CRLF
# on checkout. Keep LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
